 Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must support AI-driven merchandising using SFCC Einstein, enabling automated product ordering on category pages and search result pages based on behavioural data and performance signals | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Additional note: Functionality to be used on sub category pages, not major pages like New Arrivals etc - not sure if feasible @Manikandan Ramachandran (Deactivated) @Victor T. Crisostomo to check | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-63> |\n| SPR-64 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must support the display of an editorial hero image, including an optional headline and body text, inline within the product grid on category pages, configurable by a business user in Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-64> |\n| SPR-65 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must display a configurable set of inline category links on the product listing page, positioned below the hero image and above the product grid. The links must be contextual, reflecting the subcategories relevant to the current page. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-65> |\n| SPR-66 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must allow business users to define and prioritise which subcategories appear inline per page in Business Manager, with the full category set remaining accessible within the filtering panel alongside standard filters. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-66> |\n| SPR-67 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | ~~The system must allow business users to insert editorial or video content into PLPs and/or feature certain products on larger tiles within the grid (manually merchandised features).~~ | Accenture | ALL |  | Confirmed | Descoped as requirement written by Zimmermann, will be design dependent | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-67> |\n| SPR-68 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must allow business users to create new filters and manually assign products to them when needed (overriding their default data). | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-68> |",
